    "ask": {
      "_doc_": "renamed from `human_input`. Single-step gate primitive. Wraps `Step(requires_user_input=True)` — pauses the pipeline to collect typed input (`text` / `confirm` / one of `choices[]`), then injects the answer as the step's output. Value collector, NOT a sequencer: no children (`io.inputs: []`). `kind: control_flow` (was `executable`) — the ask node is a gate, not an executor; same architectural class as compound nodes. Edge semantics unchanged: ask still participates as a dataflow node, just under the new kind/label.",
      "kind": "control_flow",
      "category": "Core",
      "displayName": "Ask",
      "i18nKey": "ask",
      "color": "border-purple-300/40 bg-purple-50 dark:bg-purple-950",
      "textColor": "text-purple-800 dark:text-purple-300",
      "icon": "AskIcon",
      "configSchemaRef": "AskConfig",
      "defaultConfig": {
        "prompt": "Please provide your input",
        "inputType": "text",
        "choices": []
      },
      "capabilities": {
